flowchart TD
    A[Structured Action Request] --> B[Collect Required Inputs]
    B --> C{Inputs Complete?}
    C -- No --> D[Deny with explicit reason]
    C -- Yes --> E[Evaluate rules and risk]
    E --> F{Decision}
    F -- Allow --> G[Continue]
    F -- Require Approval --> H[Approval Lifecycle]
    F -- Deny --> D
